---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer id="book" class="border-t border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 bg-white dark:bg-[#121212] transition-colors duration-200">
  <div class="px-4 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 py-14 sm:py-20 lg:py-28">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-center pb-12 sm:pb-16 border-b border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800">
      
      <!-- Left: Big Heading -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-3 sm:space-y-4">
        <h2 data-i18n="footer.heading" class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight leading-[1.15]">
          Sistemlerinizin büyümeye hazır olup olmadığını görün <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
          <span class="text-dj-italics text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">(kesinlikle hazır)</span>
        </h2>
        <p data-i18n="footer.desc" class="text-sm sm:text-base text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 max-w-lg leading-relaxed pt-1 sm:pt-2">
          GHL otomasyonları ve yapay zekâ sistemleri hakkında 15 dakikalık hızlı bir tanışma ve mimari görüşmesi planlayın.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Action Box -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 w-full">
        <div class="rounded-2xl sm:rounded-3xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 bg-[#f9fafb] dark:bg-[#181818] p-5 sm:p-8 space-y-5 sm:space-y-6 shadow-sm transition-colors">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl bg-black dark:bg-white text-white dark:text-black flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm shrink-0">
              15
            </div>
            <div>
              <div data-i18n="footer.callTitle" class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">15 Dakikalık Tanışma Görüşmesi</div>
              <div data-i18n="footer.callSub" class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400 font-mono">Takvim üzerinden hemen seçin</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <a
            href="/contact"
            class="block w-full py-3.5 sm:py-4 px-6 rounded-full bg-black dark:bg-white text-white dark:text-black text-center font-bold text-xs hover:bg-neutral-800 dark:hover:bg-neutral-200 transition-all shadow-md"
          >
            <span data-i18n="footer.callBtn">Görüşme Zamanı Belirle →</span>
          </a>

          <div class="pt-1 sm:pt-2 text-center">
            <span data-i18n="footer.emailNote" class="text-xs text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">Doğrudan e-posta yazmayı mı tercih edersiniz?</span> <br />
            <a href="mailto:iletisim@ercankurtoglu.site" class="text-xs font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white underline hover:text-neutral-700 dark:hover:text-neutral-300 mt-1 inline-block break-all">
              iletisim@ercankurtoglu.site
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom credits -->
    <div class="pt-6 sm:pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between text-xs text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400 gap-4 text-center sm:text-left">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="font-extrabold text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">Ercan Kurtoğlu</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span>GoHighLevel & AI Architecture</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4 sm:gap-6">
        <a href="https://github.com/ErcanKurtoglu" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-black dark:hover:text-white transition-colors font-medium">GitHub</a>
        <a href="https://linkedin.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-black dark:hover:text-white transition-colors font-medium">LinkedIn</a>
        <a href="https://x.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-black dark:hover:text-white transition-colors font-medium">X (Twitter)</a>
        <span>© {year} <span data-i18n="footer.copy">Tüm hakları saklıdır.</span></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
